{"id":"ab6e61983fd840a5","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-resolution-width.md","title":"归结反驳的子句宽度","display":"df-resolution-width — 归结反驳的子句宽度","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-resolution-width","aliases":["72-df-resolution-width"],"display":"df-resolution-width — 归结反驳的子句宽度","depends_on":["[[72-df-resolution-system]]"],"chapter":"VIII","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.VIII resolution and restrictions §§8.3,9.2, print598,607–612/PDF610,619–624; local width measure","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_deep":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-resolution-width"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-resolution-width</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-resolution-width — 归结反驳的子句宽度"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e585861c4ee3b135\" href=\"?note=e585861c4ee3b135\" title=\"72-df-resolution-system\">72-df-resolution-system</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"VIII"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.VIII resolution and restrictions §§8.3,9.2, print598,607–612/PDF610,619–624; local width measure"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Clause}^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Clause}^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>，F有限；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\infty\">\\(\\infty\\)</span> 为大于所有自然数的附加元素，空序列的最大宽度取0。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{wd}(\\pi):=\\max(\\{0\\}\\cup\\{|C|:C\\in\\operatorname{ran}(\\pi)\\}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{wd}(\\pi):=\\max(\\{0\\}\\cup\\{|C|:C\\in\\operatorname{ran}(\\pi)\\}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{rw}(F):=\\begin{cases}\n\\min\\{\\operatorname{wd}(\\pi):\\operatorname{ResRefutation}(\\pi,F)\\},&amp;\\exists\\pi\\ \\operatorname{ResRefutation}(\\pi,F),\\\\\n\\infty,&amp;\\neg\\exists\\pi\\ \\operatorname{ResRefutation}(\\pi,F).\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{rw}(F):=\\begin{cases}\n\\min\\{\\operatorname{wd}(\\pi):\\operatorname{ResRefutation}(\\pi,F)\\},&amp;\\exists\\pi\\ \\operatorname{ResRefutation}(\\pi,F),\\\\\n\\infty,&amp;\\neg\\exists\\pi\\ \\operatorname{ResRefutation}(\\pi,F).\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>宽度数文字出现集合的基数，不是证明 DAG 的深度，也不是二进制编码长度。有限反驳时最大值存在；最小值只在反驳非空的分支取。此处不引用本书之后出现的大小—宽度深层定理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-resolution-system","status":"resolved","id":"e585861c4ee3b135","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-resolution-system]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Clause}^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\infty","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{wd}(\\pi):=\\max(\\{0\\}\\cup\\{|C|:C\\in\\operatorname{ran}(\\pi)\\}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{rw}(F):=\\begin{cases}\n\\min\\{\\operatorname{wd}(\\pi):\\operatorname{ResRefutation}(\\pi,F)\\},&\\exists\\pi\\ \\operatorname{ResRefutation}(\\pi,F),\\\\\n\\infty,&\\neg\\exists\\pi\\ \\operatorname{ResRefutation}(\\pi,F).\n\\end{cases}","display":true}],"bytes":1485,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-75","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VIII章新增8项：[[72-df-clause-restriction]] · [[72-df-polynomially-padded-proof-system]] · [[72-df-resolution-width]] · [[72-lem-clause-restriction-semantics]] · [[72-thm-polynomial-boundedness-simulation]] · [[72-thm-polynomial-padding-comparison]] · [[72-thm-proof-system-join-universal]] · [[72-thm-resolution-restriction]]"},{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-71","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VIII章新增8项：[[72-df-clause-restriction]] · [[72-df-polynomially-padded-proof-system]] · [[72-df-resolution-width]] · [[72-lem-clause-restriction-semantics]] · [[72-thm-polynomial-boundedness-simulation]] · [[72-thm-polynomial-padding-comparison]] · [[72-thm-proof-system-join-universal]] · [[72-thm-resolution-restriction]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-69","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VIII章新增8项：[[72-df-clause-restriction]] · [[72-df-polynomially-padded-proof-system]] · [[72-df-resolution-width]] · [[72-lem-clause-restriction-semantics]] · [[72-thm-polynomial-boundedness-simulation]] · [[72-thm-polynomial-padding-comparison]] · [[72-thm-proof-system-join-universal]] · [[72-thm-resolution-restriction]]"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-71","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VIII章新增8项：[[72-df-clause-restriction]] · [[72-df-polynomially-padded-proof-system]] · [[72-df-resolution-width]] · [[72-lem-clause-restriction-semantics]] · 